{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dO34lIDpFVxc977a2eBlQA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:47.248447+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dO34lIDpFVxc977a2eBlQA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dysR92C5KbSEemhRsrYEWygu51CXA5OFNQV1ZTdqFW9icQju8zdu5SKNC7xgjEUxk8dfTias5XrqselPYbeuKyMFRdSo3vCPdWiaicRRhVE1J4g/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生（以下简称“推免生”）工作是研究生招生工作的重要组成部分，是提高研究生选拔质量，培养拔尖创新人才的重要保证。为了切实做好推免生接收工作，根据西北师范大学《关于做好2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作的通知》，现将有关事宜安排如下：</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>接收原则</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）坚持公平公正、综合评价、择优录取、宁缺毋滥的原则，全面考察推免生德智体美劳等方面表现。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><span>（二）学院2027年硕士研究生招生简章公布的全日制招生专业均可接收推免生，非全日制专业不接收推免生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）各硕士研究生招生专业接收推免生人数原则上不得超过本专业2027年招生计划人数的50%，具体招生计划以学校2027年硕士研究生招生简章公布的招生计划为准。</span></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>组织机构</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院成立招生工作领导小组，具体负责各专业推免生的接收、考核及复试工作。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>接收对象</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>具有推荐免试授权高校的应届本科毕业生，并获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>接收条件</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>思想政治素质优良、遵纪守法、品学兼优、身心健康、诚实守信。同时具备以下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）获得本科所在高校推荐免试资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）本科学习期间成绩优秀，所有学业成绩合格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）诚实守信、学风端正、无违纪记录、无有效期内的处分；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）具有良好的学术专长和较大发展潜力，具有较强的创新意识和创新能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>同等条件下可优先接收学习奖励获得者、在学期间发表过学术论文或科研成果者和各种荣誉称号获得者。</span></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>05</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>接收流程</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>第二条</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><strong><span>报名</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>获得推免生资格的考生预计于9月18日起可以登录中国研究生招生信息网“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）登记注册。9月21日，推免生查询招生章程和专业目录，填写报考志愿。未在推免生服务系统中报名、未接收复试通知、未接收待录取通知的推免生不能被录取。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><strong><span>发送复试通知</span></strong></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院登录推免生服务系统查看各专业推免生报考情况并发送复试通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><strong><span>组织复试</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>01</span></span></section></section><section><section><span>拟复试时间：</span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>9月21日—10月18日</span></strong></span><span>期间，具体以复试通知为准。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>02</span></span></section></section><section><section><span>复试要求：</span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>复试采用线上线下相结合的方式进行，通过面试考查考生的身心健康状态、思维敏锐程度、语言表达能力、专业基础知识、逻辑思维能力以及综合分析能力、解决实际问题的能力等。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>复试考生需提交材料：</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>（1）《接收推荐免试攻读研究生申请表》；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科阶段学习成绩单（加盖学校教务管理部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）大学英语（法语、日语、德语）四级、六级证书；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）其他获奖证书、所发表的与专业相关的文章等材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）西北师范大学研究生考试诚信复试承诺书。</span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dO34lIDpFVxc977a2eBlQA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件：西北师范大学研究生考试诚信复试承诺书.docx</span></a></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>04</span></span></section></section><section><section><span>复试结果：</span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>复试成绩满分100分，60分为及格，复试成绩不及格者不予录取。</span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>05</span></span></section></section><section><section><span>上报复试结果：</span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院将参加复试考生的成绩、拟录取专业等信息填写后提交研究生院审核。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><strong><span>发放待录取通知</span></strong></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院对复试合格考生报研究生院审核后在中国研究生招生信息网发放待录取通知，考生接收待录取通知确定录取资格。未在规定时间内接收待录取的考生取消录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><strong><span>公示</span></strong></section></section></section><p><span><span>复试结束后学院将参加复试考生的复试成绩、录取专业等信息报研究生院，经学校研究生招生委员会批准后进行公示，公示期为7天。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>06</span></strong></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>其它</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>（一）学院结合本专业要求和推免生实际，对接收推免生做好统筹规划，做到校内校外兼顾，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）被学院接收的推免生，不得再次报名参加全国硕士研究生招生入学统一考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）被录取的推免生在2027年研究生入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书、体检不合格者等不符合录取资格的情况，学校将取消其录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）录取推免生体检工作统一安排在新生入学报到时进行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）申请人所提供的信息和材料不真实或不准确，一经发现，将取消申请人的复试、录取资格或学籍，后果由本人负责。</span></span></p><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>联系人</span></span></strong><span>：</span><span><span>张老师</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系电话</span></span></strong><span><span>：0931-7971301</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span>END</span></span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>编辑 | 臧炳坤</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编 | 雷春芳 冯乐婷</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 胡勇</span></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dysR92C5KbQXLTLdrkKVaWfr0gSgNJThgJZjRk8iaNK8LaH7C4ibiaLmONIkRN6mq1btsTlRnKcRiaYFtU2GgXOg6GBvD5ibLErl3BcuCTB75I4w/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4452ac0b9572e920867b7ff405c69ef9fede1dfe40d64dede38f4ffef38cf84d","textLength":1642,"sourceSha256":"5abc49b592a6b5179fd8ee75365293caa87cd79e3919ee5c704988e2eebaafa0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9f6e3a664b4d99f9c0d7","title":"2026年西北师范大学法学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:47.248447+00:00"}
